    "srn.dialog.elf.game_start.0":"天哪，我这是在哪？",
    "srn.dialog.elf.game_start.1":"让我想想…先去找礼物…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.game_start.2":"…然后把它们都放到中心圣诞树下",
    "srn.dialog.elf.game_start.3":"总共%s个礼物…日出前必须全部收集完",
    "srn.dialog.elf.game_start.4":"嗯？好像有人醒了！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.almost_timeout.0":"糟糕！太阳快升起来了！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.almost_timeout.1":"得抓紧时间了…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.claim_gift.0":"正是时候！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.claim_gift.1":"完美！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.claim_gift.2":"搞定…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.claim_gift.3":"又完成一个！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.dash.0":"…哇哦，感觉身体轻盈了好多…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.dash.1":"按[%s]就能冲刺一会，速度会快很多",
    "srn.dialog.elf.dash.2":"…嘿，这下谁也拦不住我！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.diningroom_puzzle_activated.0":"哇，好有趣的小东西！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.diningroom_puzzle_activated.1":"得把它们放回原位…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.diningroom_puzzle_deactivated.0":"啊，它们又回到原位了…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.diningroom_puzzle_deactivated.1":"幸好我不用重新做整件事",
    "srn.dialog.elf.egged.0":"啊！什么…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.egged.1":"我看不见了！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.egged.2":"好臭！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.hidden.0":"哦，多独特的物品…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.hidden.1":"居然大小正合适！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.hidden.2":"按[%s]就能隐身偷偷溜过去！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.hidden.3":"不过，我仍然很脆弱…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.in_hat.0":"嗯，这里还挺舒服的…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.in_hat.1":"但我在这里什么都看不见…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.in_hat.2":"这东西放在这儿也太违和了…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.in_hat.3":"…它应该是属于别的东西的吧？",
    "srn.dialog.elf.in_hat.4":"我最好小心点过去…就算被人发现了，我也能跑掉",
    "srn.dialog.elf.jar_freed.0":"谢谢你，%s！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.jarred.0":"啊啊啊！！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.jarred.1":"我的礼物全没了，这下惨了！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.jarred.2":"救救我！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.livingroom_puzzle_activated.0":"嗯…它没电到我…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.livingroom_puzzle_activated.1":"试试用这个点亮整个房间…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.livingroom_puzzle_activated.2":"最好快点做",
    "srn.dialog.elf.livingroom_puzzle_deactivated.0":"啊，看来我碰不了地板…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.livingroom_puzzle_deactivated.1":"…也不能离开房间",
    "srn.dialog.elf.livingroom_puzzle_deactivated.2":"我还得确保按正确顺序点亮！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.masterbedroom_puzzle.0":"哇…嗯…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.masterbedroom_puzzle.1":"奇怪的声音…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.masterbedroom_puzzle.2":"哦，我开始看出规律了！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.masterbedroom_puzzle.3":"…按照那个规律来操作…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.masterbedroom_puzzle_fail.0":"嗯，这听起来不对…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.pre_sneeze.0":"哎…这房子灰尘太多了！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.pre_sneeze.1":"我需要继续跑！嗯…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.scared.0":"啊！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.scared.1":"什么…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.scared.2":"呃，光是那个…噪音就让我耳鸣…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.sneezed.0":"哈啾！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.sneezed.1":"*吸鼻子* 啊，保佑我…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.sneezed.2":"…呃哦，没人听到吧？",
    "srn.dialog.elf.strength.0":"嗯嗯，真好吃！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.strength.1":"感觉变大了，跳的也更有劲了！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.strength.2":"人类的食物我怎么吃都吃不够…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.trapped.0":"哎呀…好疼",
    "srn.dialog.elf.trapped.1":"拜托…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.wisdom.0":"嗯，这东西看起来真酷…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.wisdom.1":"啊…哇…我现在能看得更清楚了！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.wisdom.2":"按住[%s]，我就能窥探各个房间里的礼物…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.wisdom.3":"…这太神奇了！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.wisdom.4":"得记下位置…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.wisdom.5":"…但我不能“看”太久，免得被人打个措手不及",
    "srn.dialog.elf.teleport.0":"嗖！",
    "srn.dialog.elf.teleport.1":"呼…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.teleport.fail_held":"带着东西时没法传送",
    "srn.dialog.elf.held_limit.0":"拿不下了…",
    "srn.dialog.elf.held_limit.1":"太沉了，实在拿不动了…",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.game_started.0":"我得小心点，爸妈还在酣睡。天亮之前，我们可别太闹腾。",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.game_started.1":"啊，对了，以防万一，我得带上我的宝贝罐子！",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.jarred.0":"哇，多酷的生物啊！",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.jarred.1":"留下来陪我玩吧？",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.jarred.2":"让我瞧瞧，这屋里还有没有像你这样的家伙...",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.jarred.3":"抓到你了！！",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.tantrum.0":"啊！我绝不让他们得逞！",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.tantrum.1":"而且我现在超想要更多小宠物的…",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.tantrum.2":"就这样！！",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.tantrum.3":"累死我了，不追了！",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.tantrum.4":"…啊，这玩意儿正好派上用场，哇哈哈哈！",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.trap_success.0":"哈！我的计划奏效了！",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.trap_success.1":"哦？是谁掉进去啦？",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.use_cracker.0":"这动静肯定特大！",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.use_cracker.1":"看看房间里有谁会被这个吓一跳…",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.use_trap.0":"让我在这里放一个…",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.use_trap.1":"那边放一个…",
    "srn.dialog.grinch.use_trap.2":"这里再放一个…"
}